# Cloudflare Pages security headers for bibprofile.com.
# Vite copies public/ into dist/, and Pages serves dist/_headers automatically.
#
# CSP is ENFORCED (F-02, audit 2026-10-13; it was report-only before). Checked first:
# no inline <script> other than JSON-LD data blocks (not executed, so not blocked), no
# inline event handlers, no javascript: URLs, no eval, and no resource from a host
# outside the policy — in dist/ and in every public/**/*.html.
#   - script-src 'self'      : the app loads only its own hashed bundle (no inline <script>).
#   - style-src needs 'unsafe-inline' : the app uses React inline style={{…}} attributes
#                                        (and inline-SVG chart styles); dropping it would break layout.
#   - connect-src            : the API hosts the app calls (our proxy, OpenAlex direct for own-key,
#                              and Crossref for retraction/correction notices — v1.4.2).
#   - form-action 'none'     : the app's two forms (own key, self-citation) never submit;
#                              their handlers call preventDefault().
#   - upgrade-insecure-requests : any stray http:// subresource is fetched over https.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://api.bibprofile.com https://api.openalex.org https://api.crossref.org; img-src 'self' data:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
